<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82719" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτᾰλον</span></b> , τό, poet.
		dat. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέταλσι</span> as well as <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετάλοις</span>, Poet. in <i><span class="en">
			<u>An. Ox.</u>
			1.121
		</span></i>, cj. in <i><span class="en">
			Simon.
			10
		</span></i> ; also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέτηλον</span></b> , first
		in <i><span class="en">
			Hes.
			<u>Sc.</u>
			289
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>Fr.</u>
			96.87
		</span></i> : (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετάννυμι</span>) :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leaf</i>, mostly pl., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.312
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				19.520
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				486
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				680
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hel.</u>
				244
			</span></i> (lyr.), etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐδαιμονίας
			πέταλον</span>, of the Olympian <i>wreath</i> of wild olive,
				<i><span class="en">
				B.
				5.186
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁβρά τε λειμώνων π</span>.
			flowers, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.23
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid.) : rare in Prose, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				5.4.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				9.15
			</span></i> ; used in divination, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.25
			</span></i> : sg. in <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>VH</u>
				5.16
			</span></i> ; poet., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεικέων πέταλα</span>
			contentious <i>votes</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεταλισμός</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>I.</u>
				8(7).46
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ὠκεανοῦ πέταλα</span>, of
			springs, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				326
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>leaf of metal</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσίων πέταλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					12.374.283
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέταλα χρυσᾶ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				22.1394.5
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χρυσίῳ ἐπίτηκτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
					442
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				138
			</span></i><span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Philops.</u>
				19
			</span></i> ; used for gilding the horns of victims, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1635.36
			</span></i> : sg., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. χρυσοῦν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ex.</u>
					28.32(36)
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πύρινα</span>, of the stars, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				2.14.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>slice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαφανῖδες κατατμηθεῖσαι εἰς πέταλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orib.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					81
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
